#
# FTS touchscreen (fts_ts). The touch driver reports the double-tap-to-wake gesture as
# KEY_POWER, which Generic.kl maps to POWER: a slow release opens the power menu and two
# gestures in a row trigger the power double-press (camera). Only wake the device instead.

key 116   WAKEUP
key 143   WAKEUP
